  "body": "Strathmill is a new development in the hills of Orewa.  With easy access to the motorway North and South and less than 5 minutes into Orewa shops and beach, this is an ideal location.\r\n\r\nBuy the land, bring your own builder : Build for investment, development opportunity or your own home.  \r\n\r\nThe section 183m2 (approximate) comes with resource consent for 3 bedrooms, 1 ensuite and a main bathroom (84.8m2 approx over frames).   With combined living and kitchen  there's plenty of room for the family, extending out onto a patio area.  \r\n\r\nFor a first family home, in zone schooling is Nukumea Primary School and Orewa College. \r\n\r\nCall us to discuss your options.\r\n\r\nAsking Price $385,000 + gst (if any)\r\n\r\n*Section image created using AI. Contour may vary\r\n\r\nViewing access: Set GPS to Mahinga Kai Road, take 1st right (Ara Taha Cresent), 2nd left is Moko Road.  Access through Flavell Drive is also now open.",
